# -----------
# Apparently the next two were jokes put in by one of the Williams
# programmers against their boss or something.  Sounds like
# something they would do.
# -----------
:003a:"I'm sorry, Jeff..."
:003b:"Jeff! You are a weenie!"
#
:003c:"My hero!"
:003d:"Thank you!"
:003e:"You saved my life!"
:003f:VOX: Girl screams
:0040:SFX: Boom 1
:0041:"Focus!"
:0042:"Move your car!"
:0043:"Hey, slide over, baby!"
:0044:"Ummm, okay!"
:0045:"Okay!"
:0046:"How about a kiss?"
:0047:"Gee, I dunno..."
:0048:"Awww, c'mon!"
:0049:"Well, maybe..."
:004a:SFX: Ahooga!
:004b:"Shoot the left ramp!"
:004c:"Jackpot!"
:004d:"Super Jackpot!"
:004e:"Let's try the next..."
